replyText:
{
  "riskLevel": "low",
  "scope": {
    "airportId": "GAO",
    "scenarioPeriod": "Simulation Day 31, 16:00"
  },
  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The newer verified simulated airport coordination report states that current stand support is sufficient and that the earlier resource shortage is resolved. It also states that no other current adverse signal is reported and that no official flight status is confirmed.",
        "zh": "较新的、经核验的模拟机场协调报告说明当前机位保障充足，先前的资源短缺已解决；同时说明没有其他当前不利信号，也未确认任何正式航班状态。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The earlier stand-support alert is marked unusable, explicitly superseded by the corrective report and retained for audit only, so it is not counted as a current adverse signal.",
        "zh": "先前的机位保障提示被标记为不可用，已由更正报告明确取代并仅留档审计，因此不作为当前不利信号计入。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Both simulated reports come from the same airport coordination source group, so this is a single source, not two independent current reports. The corrective report was checked only against the fictitious scenario log, not real operational verification.",
        "zh": "两份模拟报告来自同一个机场协调来源组，因此只有一个来源，而不是两份独立的当前报告；更正报告仅对照虚构情景日志核对，并非真实运行核验。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY", "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Official flight status remains unconfirmed; no official status source is identified for this scenario, so nothing can be said about individual flights.",
        "zh": "正式航班状态仍未确认；本情景未提供正式状态来源，因此无法就任何单个航班作出说明。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The historical monthly baseline covers 24 rows from 2024-01 through 2025-12 and contains one five-point anomaly: 2025-02 completed-as-planned 72.88%, 6.10 percentage points below its prior 12-month mean. This calls for focused historical review, not a current risk rating or a weather attribution.",
        "zh": "历史月度基线覆盖2024-01至2025-12共24行，含一个五点异常：2025-02按计划完成航班比例为72.88%，低于此前12个月平均6.10个百分点。这需要开展聚焦的历史复核，既不代表当前风险等级，也不能归因于天气。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion", "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The most recent monthly row, 2025-12, shows completed-as-planned at 79.44%, which is 0.90 percentage points above its prior 12-month mean, so no current monthly anomaly is indicated going into the assessed period.",
        "zh": "最近一个月度行2025-12按计划完成航班比例为79.44%，高于此前12个月平均0.90个百分点，因此进入评估时段时未显示当前月度异常。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-12"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-12:completion", "OPS-GAO-2025-12:delta"]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Airport scale is modest and airline business importance is recorded as low: 2025 shows 10.73 million passengers and 18,050 aircraft movements.",
        "zh": "机场规模有限，航空公司业务重要程度记录为低：2025年为1073万人次旅客吞吐量和18050架次起降。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["SCALE-GAO-2025"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The September 2025 weather row carries a missing-data flag, so any weather-based reasoning for that month is limited; it does not affect the current stand-support question.",
        "zh": "2025年9月天气行带缺数标记，该月的任何天气推断都受限；这不影响当前机位保障问题。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["WX-GAO-2025-09"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Rule RULE005 applies because there is a resource situation but no official flight status: passenger text must be a clearly marked draft and approved by a person before any sending.",
        "zh": "由于存在资源情况但没有正式航班状态，适用规则RULE005：旅客文本必须是明确标注的草案，并在发送前经人工批准。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Numbers and formal status statements must cite source records and time scope (RULE009), all simulated material must be labelled as simulation (RULE010), and no passenger or staff personal data may be retained (RULE011).",
        "zh": "数字和正式状态表述必须列明来源记录和时间范围（RULE009），所有模拟材料必须标注为模拟（RULE010），且不得保存旅客或员工个人信息（RULE011）。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010", "RULE011"],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Per the corrective simulated report, the previously flagged stand-support constraint is resolved, so no capacity-driven disruption to ground handling is indicated at this time.",
        "zh": "根据更正后的模拟报告，先前标记的机位保障限制已解决，因此目前没有显示由容量引起的地面保障中断。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "If the corrective report does not cover the specific stands or time window used by our flights, a residual local constraint could still exist.",
        "zh": "如果更正报告未覆盖我方航班使用的具体机位或时间窗口，仍可能存在局部残余限制。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Specific affected flights and their official status are unknown, so any per-flight operational consequence cannot be stated.",
        "zh": "具体受影响航班及其正式状态未知，因此无法说明任何单个航班的运行后果。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "The corrective report covers the same stands and flights as the superseded alert, not a narrower scope.",
      "zh": "更正报告覆盖的范围与被取代提示相同，而非更窄范围。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The corrective report is still the newest airport coordination information at the scenario time.",
      "zh": "更正报告在情景时刻仍是最新的机场协调信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No separate adverse signal exists from another source group; the two simulated reports are not independent.",
      "zh": "没有来自其他来源组的独立不利信号；两份模拟报告并不独立。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Resolved stand support also means ground handling and gate resources are unconstrained, which is not stated in the report.",
      "zh": "机位保障解决是否同时意味着地面保障和登机口资源不受限，报告未作说明。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "The specific flights and stands affected by the earlier alert are not identified.",
      "zh": "先前提及的具体受影响航班和机位未予识别。"
    },
    {
      "en": "There is no official flight status source for this scenario, so delay or cancellation status cannot be confirmed either way.",
      "zh": "本情景没有正式航班状态来源，因此延误或取消状态无法从任何方向确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The report addresses stand support only; no information is supplied on other resource categories.",
      "zh": "报告只涉及机位保障，未提供其他资源类别的信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Only one source group is represented, so cross-source corroboration is missing.",
      "zh": "仅有一个来源组，缺少跨来源印证。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The report's verification is a fictitious scenario-log check by an evaluation reviewer, not a live operational confirmation.",
      "zh": "该报告的核验是评估人员对照虚构情景日志的检查，并非实时运行确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "September 2025 weather data is flagged missing, limiting any weather-related historical read.",
      "zh": "2025年9月天气数据被标记为缺失，限制任何与天气相关的历史判断。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "verify",
    "text": {
      "en": "Verify with airport coordination, for the record, that the corrective simulated report covers the stands and the time window relevant to our operation, and note its update time and scope. Do not treat this as flight-level confirmation.",
      "zh": "向机场协调方核实并留档：该更正模拟报告覆盖我方运行相关的机位和时间窗口，并记录其更新时间与范围。不要将其视为航班层面的确认。"
    },
    "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY"],
    "ruleIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010"]
  },
  "subsequentActions": [
    {
      "id": "follow-1",
      "kind": "prepare_information",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare a short internal information note stating that, per the corrected simulated airport report, on-site stand support is sufficient and the earlier shortage is resolved, while noting that no official flight status is confirmed and that this is simulation material.",
        "zh": "准备一份简短内部信息说明：根据更正后的模拟机场报告，现场机位保障充足、先前短缺已解决；同时注明未确认任何正式航班状态，且材料为模拟。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "RULE010"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-2",
      "kind": "monitor",
      "text": {
        "en": "Monitor for any further airport coordination report that reintroduces a capacity shortfall or reports expanding impact, and record the update time of each new report.",
        "zh": "监测是否再有机场协调报告重新提出容量短缺或报告影响范围扩大，并记录每份新报告的更新时间。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE009"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-3",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare a passenger-facing draft for human approval that states only public facts, marks itself as simulation and draft, and directs passengers to official airline and airport channels for their own flight status.",
        "zh": "准备一份供人工批准的旅客版草案：仅陈述可公开事实，标注为模拟与草案，并引导旅客通过航空公司及机场官方渠道查询自身航班状态。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-4",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": {
        "en": "Run the focused historical review of the single February 2025 five-point dip against its prior 12-month window, checking data completeness and same-category peers, without attributing it to weather.",
        "zh": "对2025年2月唯一的五点下降开展聚焦历史复核，对照其此前12个月窗口，检查数据完整性和同类机场情况，且不将其归因于天气。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02", "RULE003"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE009"]
    }
  ],
  "escalationConditions": [
    {
      "en": "A new airport coordination report indicates insufficient stand support or an expanding impact.",
      "zh": "新的机场协调报告显示机位保障不足或影响范围扩大。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any official flight status change affecting our flights is issued by an identified official source.",
      "zh": "由可识别的官方来源发布影响我方航班的任何正式航班状态变更。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The reliability of a current incident-level report is recorded as unknown, which would stop action conclusions and require escalation.",
      "zh": "当前事件级报告的来源可靠性被记录为未知，这将停止行动结论并要求升级。"
    },
    {
      "en": "A safety-related issue is raised in connection with the resource situation.",
      "zh": "与资源情况相关的安全问题被提出。"
    }
  ],
  "humanDecisions": [
    {
      "en": "Operations lead decides whether the internal information note may be circulated and to whom.",
      "zh": "运营负责人决定内部信息说明是否可分发以及分发范围。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Passenger service lead decides whether any passenger wording is used and in which channel.",
      "zh": "旅客服务负责人决定是否使用旅客措辞以及使用的渠道。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Operations lead confirms the accepted scope and update time of the corrective report before it is relied on.",
      "zh": "运营负责人在依赖更正报告前，确认其被接受的范围和更新时间。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Status update for GAO at the simulated 16:00 period: the corrected airport coordination report states current stand support is sufficient and the earlier shortage is resolved; the superseded alert is retained for audit only. Prioritised checks before relying on this: (1) confirm the corrective report covers our stands and time window, and record its update time; (2) confirm whether ground handling and gate resources are covered or only stands; (3) confirm no separate adverse signal exists from another source group; (4) identify which of our flights, if any, were inside the earlier alert window; (5) keep the February 2025 five-point dip on the historical review list, not on the current risk list. No flight status is confirmed; do not state delays or cancellations.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。GAO 在模拟16:00时段的状态更新：更正后的机场协调报告说明当前机位保障充足、先前短缺已解决；被取代的提示仅留档审计。在依赖此信息前按优先顺序核查：（1）确认更正报告覆盖我方机位与时间窗口，并记录其更新时间；（2）确认报告是否涵盖地面保障与登机口资源，还是仅限机位；（3）确认没有来自其他来源组的独立不利信号；（4）识别我方是否有航班落在先前提示的时间窗口内；（5）把2025年2月的五点下降放在历史复核清单，而非当前风险清单。未确认任何航班状态，不得表述延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY", "OPS-GAO-2025-02", "RULE009", "RULE010"]
    },
    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. To airport coordination, for confirmation only: (1) does your corrected report of the simulated 16:05 update cover all stands used by our flights for the 16:00 period, or a narrower scope? (2) are ground handling, gate and deicing resources also confirmed sufficient, or only stand support? (3) is any residual restriction, priority rule or stand substitution still in force? (4) what is the report's effective update time and when will the next update be issued? (5) was the superseded alert withdrawn in full, or does any part remain for audit only? Please reply in writing so the scope and time can be recorded.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。致机场协调方，仅用于确认：（1）贵方模拟16:05更新的更正报告是否覆盖我方航班在16:00时段使用的全部机位，还是范围更窄？（2）地面保障、登机口与除冰资源是否也确认充足，还是仅机位保障？（3）是否仍存在残余限制、优先规则或机位替换要求？（4）报告的有效更新时间为何时，下一次更新何时发布？（5）先前的提示是否已全部撤回，还是有部分仅留档审计？请书面回复，以便记录范围与时间。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY", "RULE009", "RULE010"]
    },
    "passenger": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Public-facing information for the simulated airport: the latest simulated airport coordination report indicates that stand support at the airport is currently sufficient and that an earlier simulated resource shortage has been resolved. This is background airport information only. No official flight status has been confirmed, so it does not mean any particular flight is on time, delayed or cancelled. Please check the official airline and airport channels for the status of your own flight, and allow extra time at the airport. This text is a draft prepared in a simulation exercise and is not an official notice.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。面向公众的模拟机场信息：最新的模拟机场协调报告显示机场机位保障目前充足，先前模拟的资源短缺已解决。此仅为机场背景信息。未确认任何正式航班状态，因此不代表任何具体航班正常、延误或取消。请通过航空公司和机场官方渠道查询您本人航班的状态，并为机场流程预留更多时间。本段文字为模拟演练中准备的草案，并非正式通知。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION", "RULE005", "RULE010"]
    }
  },
  "evidenceReferences": [
    "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION",
    "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-02",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-12",
    "SCALE-GAO-2025",
    "WX-GAO-2025-09",
    "RULE003",
    "RULE005",
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011"
  ],
  "ruleIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010", "RULE011", "RULE005"],
  "decisionConstraints": {
    "professionalDecisionRequired": false,
    "actionConclusionsStopped": false,
    "triggeredRuleIds": [],
    "decisionScope": "Add information that on-site resources are sufficient.",
    "reviewerRoles": [
      {
        "en": "Operations lead",
        "zh": "运营负责人"
      }
    ]
  },
  "outputStatus": "needs_review"
}
